{"seq":1,"slug":"flux-redux","title":"Flux 与 Redux 单向数据流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-management/patterns/flux-redux","wordCount":1420,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"flux-与-redux-单向数据流\">Flux 与 Redux 单向数据流</h1><p>2014 年 Facebook 公布 Flux 架构时,要解决的是一个具体的痛:聊天通知的未读数老是对不上。根因是双向绑定下数据可以从四面八方被改,改乱了根本无从追查。Flux 给出的药方近乎偏执——所有状态变更只能走一个方向,一条单行道,任何捷径都禁止。Redux 把这套理念提炼成三条公理并配上一个杀手级调试器,统治了 React 状态管理近十年。即便 2026 年它在新项目里的份额已被 Zustand 等蚕食,理解单向数据流仍是理解其他一切范式的基准线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单向数据流的精髓是:状态是只读的,改变状态的唯一方式是派发(dispatch)一个描述「发生了什么」的 action,由一个纯函数 reducer 根据当前 state 和 action 算出新 state。数据只朝一个方向流动,形成一个闭环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[View 视图] --&gt;|用户交互| B[dispatch action]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Store]&#10;  C --&gt;|当前 state + action| D[Reducer 纯函数]&#10;  D --&gt;|返回新 state| C&#10;  C --&gt;|订阅通知| A&#10;  D -.-&gt;|&quot;newState = reducer(state, action)&quot;| D\">flowchart TD\n  A[View 视图] --&gt;|用户交互| B[dispatch action]\n  B --&gt; C[Store]\n  C --&gt;|当前 state + action| D[Reducer 纯函数]\n  D --&gt;|返回新 state| C\n  C --&gt;|订阅通知| A\n  D -.-&gt;|\"newState = reducer(state, action)\"| D</pre><p>Redux 把这套理念压缩成三条公理,违反任何一条都会破坏可预测性。理解这三条,就理解了 Redux 的全部约束来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>违反的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一真相源</td>\n<td>整个应用状态存在一棵 state 树里</td>\n<td>多源不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态只读</td>\n<td>只能通过 dispatch action 改状态</td>\n<td>无法追踪变更来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯函数变更</td>\n<td>reducer 必须是纯函数,不可变更新</td>\n<td>时间旅行失效、调试困难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是单向-可预测性的代价与回报\">为什么是单向:可预测性的代价与回报</h2><p>单向数据流的全部价值压在「可预测」三个字上。因为状态只能由 reducer 这一个纯函数、依据明确的 action 来改变,应用在任意时刻的状态都等于初始状态被一串 action 依次作用的结果。形式化地说,设初始状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,action 序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,则当前状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>reduce</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_n = \\text{reduce}(s_{n-1}, a_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reduce</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>,整个历史可由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 action 序列完全重放。</p>\n<p>这个性质直接催生了 Redux 最被称道的能力:时间旅行调试——你可以前后回放每一个 action,看着状态一步步演变,甚至「撤销」某个 action。这是其他范式难以企及的,具体能力在 <a href=\"../engineering/testing-devtools\">测试与调试工具</a>里展开。代价同样明确:为了这份纪律,每改一个值你都要定义 action 类型、写 reducer 分支、有时还要中间件处理异步,样板代码堆积如山。这正是 Redux 长期被诟病、并最终催生轻量替代品的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"redux-toolkit-把样板砍到能接受\">Redux Toolkit:把样板砍到能接受</h2><p>针对样板问题,Redux 官方在 2019 年推出 Redux Toolkit(RTK),并在此后将其确立为「编写 Redux 的标准方式」。到 2026 年,直接手写原始 Redux 已被视为反模式,RTK 是唯一推荐写法。它在几个关键处大幅压缩样板:<code>createSlice</code> 一次性生成 action creators 和 reducer;内置 Immer,让你在 reducer 里写「看似可变」的代码(<code>state.value += 1</code>)却自动产出不可变更新;<code>configureStore</code> 零配置接好 DevTools 和常用中间件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { createSlice, configureStore } from &#39;@reduxjs/toolkit&#39;;&#10;&#10;const counterSlice = createSlice({&#10;  name: &#39;counter&#39;,&#10;  initialState: { value: 0 },&#10;  reducers: {&#10;    increment: (state) =&gt; {&#10;      state.value += 1;&#10;    }, // Immer 让这行安全&#10;    addBy: (state, action) =&gt; {&#10;      state.value += action.payload;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const { increment, addBy } = counterSlice.actions;&#10;export const store = configureStore({ reducer: { counter: counterSlice.reducer } });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createSlice, configureStore } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@reduxjs/toolkit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> counterSlice</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSlice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'counter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initialState: { value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reducers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Immer 让这行安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    addBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action.payload;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">addBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counterSlice.actions;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> store</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> configureStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ reducer: { counter: counterSlice.reducer } });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 reducer 里直接对 <code>state</code> 赋值——这看起来违反了「不可变更新」公理,但 Immer 在底层把这些「草稿变更」转换成了真正的不可变新对象,既保住了公理又消灭了手写展开运算符的痛苦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异步与中间件-单向流之外的逃生口\">异步与中间件:单向流之外的逃生口</h2><p>reducer 必须是纯函数,意味着发请求、读时间这类副作用不能写在 reducer 里。Redux 用中间件在 dispatch 和 reducer 之间开一个口子来处理异步。早期是 redux-thunk、redux-saga,而 RTK 时代主推 <code>createAsyncThunk</code>,它把一次异步操作自动映射成 pending/fulfilled/rejected 三个 action,让你在 reducer 里分别处理三种状态。</p>\n<p>不过到 2026 年,一个重要的认知转变是:Redux 不该再用来管理服务端状态。异步数据获取、缓存、失效这套需求有专门工具(RTK 自带的 RTK Query,或更通用的 TanStack Query)来声明式地解决,远比手写 thunk 优雅。这条边界——客户端共享状态用 Redux/Zustand、服务端状态用专门库——是现代架构的基石,在 <a href=\"../server-state/data-fetching-cache\">数据获取与缓存</a>与 <a href=\"../engineering/state-architecture\">状态架构与选型</a>里详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的定位-谁还该用-redux\">2026 年的定位:谁还该用 Redux</h2><p>Redux 在新项目里的统治力确实在退潮。社区共识是:Zustand 约 3KB、几乎零样板,适合绝大多数新项目;而 Redux Toolkit 连同 react-redux 约 15KB,样板仍重(来源:<a href=\"https://dev.to/jsgurujobs/state-management-in-2026-zustand-vs-jotai-vs-redux-toolkit-vs-signals-2gge\">dev.to</a>)。那 Redux 还剩什么主场?答案是:需要严格约定的大团队(社区常说的 50 人以上工程团队),以及真正复杂、需要时间旅行调试的状态机。换句话说,Redux 用纪律和可追溯性换 DX,只有当这份纪律的价值超过样板成本时才划算。它仍是企业级、强约定场景的机构性选择(来源:<a href=\"https://tech-insider.org/zustand-vs-redux-2026/\">tech-insider</a>)。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单向数据流为根治双向绑定的不可追踪而生:状态只读,唯一改法是 dispatch action 经 reducer 纯函数产出新 state。</li>\n<li>Redux 三公理(单一真相源、状态只读、纯函数变更)是其全部约束的来源,换来可预测性与时间旅行调试。</li>\n<li>Redux Toolkit 是 2026 年唯一推荐写法,用 createSlice + Immer + configureStore 把样板砍到可接受,手写原始 Redux 已是反模式。</li>\n<li>副作用经中间件处理,但服务端状态应交给专门库,不再用 Redux 手搓——这是现代架构的关键边界。</li>\n<li>Redux 在新项目份额退潮,主场收窄到大团队强约定与复杂状态机;多数新项目转向更轻的 Zustand。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Flux 与 Redux 单向数据流","id":"flux-与-redux-单向数据流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是单向:可预测性的代价与回报","id":"为什么是单向-可预测性的代价与回报"},{"level":2,"text":"Redux Toolkit:把样板砍到能接受","id":"redux-toolkit-把样板砍到能接受"},{"level":2,"text":"异步与中间件:单向流之外的逃生口","id":"异步与中间件-单向流之外的逃生口"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的定位:谁还该用 Redux","id":"2026-年的定位-谁还该用-redux"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"局部与全局状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-management/foundations/local-vs-global"},"next":{"title":"原子化状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-management/patterns/atomic-state"}}